  "html": "<div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:252px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Monster-_Frigid_Dread_Mantis.png\" title=\"GorgeNFloss\"><img alt=\"GorgeNFloss\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"286\" src=\"/images/recovered/Monster-_Frigid_Dread_Mantis.png\" width=\"250\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/recovered/Monster-_Frigid_Dread_Mantis.png\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>GorgeNFloss</div></div></div>\n<p>This is the second big bug you will encounter in <a href=\"/wiki/Frump's_Misfortune\" title=\"Frump's Misfortune\">The Boardroom</a> at the end of <a href=\"/wiki/Frump's_Misfortune\" title=\"Frump's Misfortune\">Frump's Misfortune</a>.   Killing the first bug, <a href=\"/wiki/Crypolyn_Kaptcher\" title=\"Crypolyn Kaptcher\">Crypolyn Kaptcher</a>, opens the door that releases GorgeNFloss and his supporters.  Although his info box shows him as a Boss, killing him does NOT open the Boss Gate so he is listed here as a Champion.  He used to drop good loot but in Build 122 does not even drop Champion loot.\n</p>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
